<h2 dir="auto">Ticking projects</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><strong>All projects</strong> now unticks everything when it's all ticked, and ticks everything otherwise. It shows a dash when only some projects are ticked.</li>
<li>With nothing ticked, the dashboard asks you to tick at least one project.</li>
<li>To look at one project alone: untick All projects, then tick it. The Only button is gone.</li>
</ul>
